TMD 基本元素

这是一个普通段落，混合了中文和 English words。段落里有 粗体、斜体、删除线 和 行内代码，也可以 又粗又斜，或者 粗体里套 代码。

A long English paragraph that should wrap at the terminal width without breaking
words in the middle, unless a single word like
Supercalifragilisticexpialidocious_and_then_some_more_letters_to_overflow is
wider than the line.

